       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPOTRACK.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.

      ******************************************************************
      *        >>>>  PURCHASE ORDER TRACKING PROGRAM  <<<<             *
      *  EACH TIME A PURCHASE ORDER ITEM QUANTITY OR ITEM COST IS      *
      *  CHANGED, A RECORD WILL BE WRITTEN TO AN AUDIT FILE.  THIS     *
      *  PROGRAM WILL BE CALLED WITH PO-TRACK-DATA (COPYLIB MEMBER     *
      *  DPOTRACK).  MOVE PO-RCV-NO INTO FIELD PO-NUM-TRACK AND MOVE   *
      *  BOTH THE OLD AND NEW COSTS AND QUANTITIES INTO THE PROPER     *
      *  FIELDS.  THE DATE/TIME STAMP AND TERMINAL/USER INFORMATION    *
      *  WILL BE ADDED IN THIS PROGRAM.                                *
      ******************************************************************
      *C*
      *C*  JUNE 06, 1996   CA YODER
      *C*    ADDED LOGIC FOR CENTURY CHANGE.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PO-TRACK-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PO-TRACK-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD         IS POTRK.
       01  POTRK.
           COPY DD-MCRPCS5600  OF MCFLCS5601.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  FILE-STATUS         PIC XX.

       01  WHO-VARIABLES.
           COPY WHOPARMS       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  PO-TRACK-DATA.
           COPY DPOTRACK       OF COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING PO-TRACK-DATA.
       START-PROCESSING.
           ACCEPT TPO-DATE-STAMP FROM DATE.
           ACCEPT TPO-TIME-STAMP FROM TIME.

      *----- CENTURY LOGIC.
           IF TPO-DATE-YY > 90
               MOVE 19         TO TPO-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20         TO TPO-DATE-CC.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WHO-VARIABLES.
           CALL "WHO"          USING MOD CAP LATTR
                               USERNAME GRPNAME ACCTNAME
                               HOMEGRP TERMNUM.

           MOVE USERNAME       TO USER-NAME.
           MOVE GRPNAME        TO USER-GROUP.
           MOVE ACCTNAME       TO USER-ACCOUNT.
           MOVE HOMEGRP        TO USER-HOME.
           MOVE TERMNUM        TO TNUM.
           MOVE TNUM           TO USER-TERM.

           IF  OLD-ITEM-PRICE = NEW-ITEM-PRICE AND
               OLD-ITEM-QTY   = NEW-ITEM-QTY
                   GOBACK.

           OPEN I-O            PO-TRACK-FILE.
           WRITE POTRK         FROM PO-TRACK-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
             DISPLAY "FAILED TO WRITE TRACKING RECORD: " FILE-STATUS.

           CLOSE               PO-TRACK-FILE.
           GOBACK.

